{"version":1,"content":"<p>【太過份了 ... 😱】相信大家也知道「大陸網盤」的商業運作模式，如果沒有課金做 VIP，下載檔案的速度簡直嚇死人。</p><p>近日，HKEPC 小編發現 GitHub 的「LinkSwift」網盤檔案下載位址取得工具，能夠直接擷取檔案的真實下載位置，無需使用官方用戶端，再配合 IDM、Aria2、BitComet 等第三方主流下載工具，透過多線程技術，就算沒有課金也能高速下載，這種工具一定要被強烈譴責。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T17:40:54.693579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T17:32:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T20:58:10.083621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T17:38:10.685443+00:00","content_hash":"42e9b894b890f15d0bc8e5b80fa6ac0857fffefb8f6eb33089b8e0842dea9c57","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}